  "prefLabel": "Env-Hw 610.01 Background Investigations",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Hw 610.01 Background Investigations. The department shall conduct a background investigation of a registrant or applicant to determine whether the registrant or applicant has sufficient reliability, expertise, integrity, and competence to transport hazardous waste in and through New Hampshire.\n\nSource. #7333, eff 8-1-00; ss by #9215, INTERIM, eff 8-1-08; (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Hw 600) ss by #9367, eff 1-28-09; ss by #12348, eff 8-14-17",
